select 'DAF-001','Data Analytics Fundamentals','Build an entry-level analytics workflow from business questions and clean data to evidence-based reporting.','active','data-analytics-fundamentals','Build an entry-level analytics workflow from business questions and clean data to evidence-based reporting.','Build an entry-level analytics workflow from business questions and clean data to evidence-based reporting. Complete a portfolio-ready analysis that combines spreadsheet cleaning, SQL summaries, visualisation and a concise stakeholder recommendation.','Data & Analytics','Beginner to job-ready',25,660,true,array['Data Analytics','Excel','SQL','Data Cleaning','Data Visualization','Business Reporting']::text[]
