stions or treating the loudest stakeholder as the only source of truth."],"one_minute_revision":"Stakeholders and Elicitation: Workplace Lab & Module Check: Apply Stakeholder analysis identifies influence, needs and decision rights; elicitation gathers evidence through suitable collaborative methods. Complete the scenario, produce evidence, explain the decision and correct the common failure: Asking leading questions or treating the loudest stakeholder as the only source of truth.","final_checklist":["I can explain the concept.","I can complete the activity.","I can validate and present the result."]},"quality_metadata":{"content_origin":"taksh_authored","review_status":"approved","copyright_review_status":"original","prompt_version":"deterministic-v2","generated_by":"taksh","sections_not_applicable":[]}}'::jsonb,1,now(),now(),now(),array['Stakeholder Management','Requirements']::text[]
