 value proposition to measurable acquisition, conversion and retention outcomes.","explanation":"A strong answer states the business or user problem before naming a tool.","skill_tested":"Marketing Strategy and Funnel: Core Concepts","difficulty":"Foundation"},{"question_number":2,"type":"reasoning","question":"How would you apply this capability in the following workplace situation: A training programme targets final-year students with different messages for discovery, evaluation and enrolment.","answer":"Set the business goal, research the audience, state the offer, map funnel stages and choose metrics before channels.","explanation":"The response should describe a controlled, verifiable workflow rather than only a feature.","skill_tested":"Marketing Strategy and Funnel: Core Concepts","difficulty":"Foundation"},{"question_number":3,"type":"application","question":"Differentiate awareness, consideration and conversion metrics.","answer":"Use Digital marketing connects a defined audience and value proposition to measurable acquisition, conversion and retention outcomes. Then describe the workflow: Set the business goal, research the audience, state the offer, map funnel stages and choose metrics before channels.","explanation":"Interview answers should connect principle, action, validation and outcome.","skill_tested":"Marketing Strategy and Funnel: Core Concepts","difficulty":"Foundation"}],"remediation":{"likely_confusion":"The concept may feel abstract before it is connected to a practical workflow.","simplified_explanation":"Digital marketing connects a defined audience and value proposition to measurable acquisition, conversion and retention outcomes.","simple_example":"A training programme targets final-year students with different messages for discovery, evaluation and enrolment.","prerequisite_to_review":"Understand","next_recommended_step":"Practise this workflow: Set the business goal, research the audience, state the offer, map funnel stages and choose m