sult follows the defined process, covers the required elements and includes a validation step.","learning_takeaway":"Avoid this common mistake: Using spaces and blank lines for layout or formatting each heading separately."}],"usage_comparisons":[],"common_mistakes":[{"mistake_number":1,"title":"Acting before understanding","incorrect_approach":"Starting immediately without confirming scope, inputs and success criteria.","why_students_make_it":"Speed can feel more important than process discipline.","why_it_is_wrong":"An incomplete process creates unreliable results and avoidable rework.","correction":"Define the outcome, complete the workflow, and validate it once.","prevention_tip":"Avoid this common mistake: Using spaces and blank lines for layout or formatting each heading separately."}],"memory_support":{"memory_aid":"Avoid this common mistake: Using spaces and blank lines for layout or formatting each heading separately.","mental_model":"Concept → Practice → Proof","quick_recall_note":"Understand → Apply → Validate"},"placement_support":{"question_identification_signals":["Assess","Word Documents: Workplace Lab & Module Check","Microsoft Word","Document Design"],"time_management_tip":"Avoid this common mistake: Using spaces and blank lines for layout or formatting each heading separately.","exam_traps":["Skipping context","Ignoring edge cases or validation"],"interview_relevance":"Use the completed activity and its validation evidence to explain your approach in interviews."},"checkpoint_questions":[{"question_number":1,"type":"application","question":"In your own words, what problem does word documents solve?","answer":"A professional Word document uses styles, structure, navigation and controlled layout instead of manual formatting.","explanation":"A strong answer states the business or user problem before naming a tool.","skill_tested":"Word Documents: Workplace Lab & Module Check","difficulty":"Foundation"},{"question_number":2,"type":"reasoning","question